to go down on every single iteration.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.640
So you plot the cost function j as a function of different iterations.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:40.600
It should decrease on every single iteration and if it ever goes up even on one iteration, then something's wrong.

